@ New game intro, delivered by Professor Arbor before the SS Minnow sets
@ sail. The player's name and gender are fixed, so this is background only:
@ the setting, who the player is, and what they are setting out to do.

gOakSpeech_Text_Introduction::
    .string "Oak. Good, you're here.\p"
    .string "Before we sail, I want you to hear\n"
    .string "the whole of it. Once.\p"
    .string "Kanto is rebuilding,\n"
    .string "one town at a time.\p"
    .string "But the towns aren't the only\n"
    .string "thing that changed.\p$"

gOakSpeech_Text_LookAtThis::
    .string "Take a look at this one…$"

gOakSpeech_Text_DescribeIntroMon::
    .string "A Wingull. A seabird from Hoenn.\p"
    .string "It was found nesting on the docks\n"
    .string "at Vermilion last spring.\p$"

gOakSpeech_Text_Migration::
    .string "It has no business being in Kanto.\n"
    .string "And it's far from the only one.\p"
    .string "Johto species. Hoenn species.\n"
    .string "Turning up in places they have\l"
    .string "never lived before.\p"
    .string "Migrations that don't match any\n"
    .string "model we have.\p"
    .string "Something is moving them.\p$"

gOakSpeech_Text_Assignment::
    .string "Silph Co. has asked for our help\n"
    .string "testing their new capture devices.\p"
    .string "That work pays for the real work:\n"
    .string "finding out what's going on\l"
    .string "out there.\p"
    .string "You'll travel Kanto. Observe.\n"
    .string "Catch. Record everything.\p"
    .string "Size. Strength. Where you found it.\n"
    .string "Data doesn't lie.\p$"

gOakSpeech_Text_SendOff::
    .string "{PLAYER}.\p"
    .string "You're young, and Kanto is still\n"
    .string "finding its feet.\p"
    .string "But someone has to be the first\n"
    .string "to get this right.\p"
    .string "Let's see what you're made of.$"
